   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Middle adulthood often involves managing multiple roles—caregiver, professional, parent, and more. Discuss how role enhancement (the positive impact of fulfilling multiple roles) and role strain (the negative impact) can affect well-being during this life stage. Reflect on strategies that individuals can use to maintain balance, prevent burnout, and sustain their sense of purpose across these varied responsibilities.",
